{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
cpuminer-opt selects its SIMD code paths at compile time. This package is
built for the baseline instruction set so it runs on any CPU, which leaves
AVX2, AVX-512, SHA and VAES hashing paths disabled.

For full speed, build the port from a ports tree with CPUTYPE set for the
mining host, for example in /etc/make.conf:

  CPUTYPE?=native
EOM
}
]
